%% TECH-005 Security hardening
%% A sign-in attempt and a writing request, with the request limit (R2) and the block (R3).
flowchart TD
    A[Writing request: server action or POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE] --> B{Signed in? R1<br/>first statement}
    B -- no --> B1[401 / redirect]
    B -- yes --> C{Origin is the site? R4}
    C -- no --> C1[Refused]
    C -- yes --> D{At most 60 in a minute<br/>for this IP? R2}
    D -- no --> D1[429, no data touched]
    D -- yes --> E[The action does its work]

    L[Login form] --> M[guardWrite: Origin and request limit]
    M --> N{IP blocked? R3}
    N -- yes --> N1[För många försök. Försök igen om en stund.]
    N -- no --> O[Write the attempt]
    O --> P{More than 6 in 15 min?}
    P -- yes --> Q[Block 20 min] --> N1
    P -- no --> R{Password matches?}
    R -- yes --> S[Delete the attempt, set the __Host- cookie R4]
    R -- no --> T{More than 5 wrong in 15 min?}
    T -- yes --> U[Block 20 min] --> V[Wait 1 s, then: Fel lösenord.]
    T -- no --> V
